"prose": [
{
"from": 211,
"to": 219,
"text": "The gates run on this Windows host during /implement. The chunk adds a product crate and changes the root manifest, so the supply-chain gates run: `cargo deny check`, the per-sync-crate tokio ban and the ban probes. The integration suite runs with `AGENT_RUN_KEEP_HOMES=1`, so the G4 schema-check reads the new homes. A boot smoke is listed because `src/cmd/run.rs` is the boot path: a mint-then-read session, `p-state-smoke`, with an idempotent pre-clean, whose `logs` read proves the start events reached a harness-booted home. The G4 schema gate and the secret scan run over the kept homes after the integration suite. The `pre-push` entry is the mutation gate: both legs plus CI's union, because the diff carries `#[cfg(unix)]` mode and stale bodies (verification-harness.md 2026-09-25). Stop rust-analyzer by exact `ExecutablePath` before it (host-win32.md 2026-09-26)."
}
],
